      "rawSource": "(Extracted from full RTF)",
      "cleanSource": "Form.Backcolor = rgb(238,238,238)\n\tLayoutMainTable.Class = ThemeClass:MainContainer\n\tTableError.Visible = False\n\t\n\t\u0026User = GAMRepository.GetUserByKeyToCompleteUserData(\u0026Errors)\n\tIf \u0026Errors.Count \u003E 0\n\t\tDo \u0027DisplayMessages\u0027\n\tElse\n\t\t//Gets last error in the GAM \n\t\t\u0026Errors = GAMRepository.GetLastErrors()\n\t\tDo \u0027DisplayMessages\u0027\n\t\t\u0026Name \t\t= \u0026User.Name\n\t\t\u0026EMail\t\t= \u0026User.EMail\n\t\t\u0026FirstName\t= \u0026User.FirstName\n\t\t\u0026LastName\t= \u0026User.LastName\n\t\t\u0026Birthday\t= \u0026User.Birthday\n\t\t\u0026Gender\t\t= \u0026User.Gender\n\tEndif\n\t\u0026Repository = GAMRepository.Get()\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\tDo \u0027AttributesSecurityCode\u0027\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */"
    },
    {
      "blockName": "Enter",
      "blockType": "Event",
      "rawSource": "(Extracted from full RTF)",
      "cleanSource": "Do \u0027CheckRequiredFields\u0027\n\tIf \u0026CheckRequiredFieldsResult\n\t\t\u0026User = GAMRepository.GetUserByKeyToCompleteUserData(\u0026Errors)\n\t\t\u0026User.Load(\u0026User.GUID)\n\t\t\u0026User.Name\t\t\t= \u0026Name\n\t\t\u0026User.EMail\t\t\t= \u0026EMail\n\t\t\u0026User.FirstName\t\t= \u0026FirstName\n\t\t\u0026User.LastName\t\t= \u0026LastName\n\t\t\u0026User.Birthday\t\t= \u0026Birthday\n\t\t\u0026User.Gender.FromString(\u0026Gender)\n\t\t\u0026isOK = GAMRepository.UpdateUserByKeyToCompleteUserData(\u0026User, \u0026Errors)\n\t\tIf \u0026isOK\n\t\t\tIf \u0026Errors.Count \u003E 0\n\t\t\t\tMsg(\u0022WWP_GAM_DataSuccessfullyUpdated\u0022)\n\t\t\t\tDo \u0027DisplayMessages\u0027\n\t\t\tElse\t\n\t\t\t\tIf GAMRepository.IsRemoteAuthentication(\u0026IDP_State)\n\t\t\t\t\t//Redirect to remote authentication\n\t\t\t\t\tGAMRepository.RedirectToRemoteAuthentication(\u0026IDP_State)\n\t\t\t\tElse\n\t\t\t\t\t\u0026URL = GAMRepository.GetLastErrorsURL()\n\t\t\t\t\tIf \u0026URL.IsEmpty()\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGAMRepository.ApplicationGoHome(GAMInternalGUIDs.AppGAMUserBackend)\n\t\t\t\t\tElse\n\t\t\t\t\t\tLink(\u0026URL)\n\t\t\t\t\tEndif\n\t\t\t\tEndif\n\t\t\tEndif\n\t\tElse\n\t\t\tDo \u0027DisplayMessages\u0027\n\t\tEndif\n\tEndif"
    },
